# {{ project_name }}

Bootstrapped with [devkit]({{ devkit_repo | replace('.git', '') }}) {{ devkit_ref }} ({{ stacks | join(', ') or 'base' }}).

## Getting started

```sh
mise trust && mise install   # tools pinned by devkit
mise run                     # pick a task
```

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `mise run lint` | every `lint:*` task (prek hooks, secrets{% for s in stacks %}, {{ s }}{% endfor %}) |
{%- if 'python' in stacks or 'go' in stacks %}
| `mise run fmt` | every formatter |
{%- endif %}
{%- if stacks %}
| `mise run test` | every `test:*` task |
| `mise run build` | every `build:*` task |
{%- endif %}

CI runs the very same tasks{% if ci %} ({{ ci | join(' and ') }}){% endif %}. Git hooks are installed by
mise when you enter the directory (`mise run setup:hooks` otherwise).

Update the tooling with `copier update`.
